# Healer's hut (MedicStation): heals own-team units and the player inside "Medic heal radius". A 4x2x4 m box (2x2
# cells), spawned origin 1.0 above the ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a stone plinth (the root), white walls with timber
# corner posts, a dark door in the -Z face with a herb bed at each side of it, a green healing cross on the +X and -X
# faces, a stepped green roof and a green light crystal floating over its peak. The child pieces are render-only.
